From 48153ba463b448f2170c3247b3259d9997ac931e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:02:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Drum groups: what it is, then how it sounds; one home per
 sound

KICKS and SNARES group by kind first (808, machine, breaks-lofi, rim) and the rest
by character under electronic/; closed hats split once under closed/; PERC groups
are instruments (hand-drums, shakers, blocks-claves, bells-cowbells, electronic)
instead of materials and "other". Shakers and tambourines are PERC's (Live's tags
and their names), and Live's Snap tag is CLAPS', so neither sits in two categories.
---
